(output-table)
*title Output-table and define integration
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*trajectory 1 rv start on 1
  *define heat-proxy-value
    heat-proxy-value = table(heat-proxy);
  *initial geodetic long=0 lat=0 psi=90 time=0 alt=120000 vel=8000 gama=-10 wt=500
  *file heat.dat time alt vel rho heat-proxy-value
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*end
